{"name": "Pulse Drive", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pulse Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tap  to the beat to build  speed!</strong> <strong>PULSE DRIVE</strong> is an arcade racing game  with a rhythm element. <br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.poster.avif?t=1787349845\" width=\"1024\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.webm?t=1787349845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.mp4?t=1787349845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive a futuristic hover vehicle, powered by musical beats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tap to the beat to go faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 unique tracks across 5 campaigns in ascending difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive, jump, fall or glide across hand crafted dreamlike environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play for medals, or compete on the leaderboards against friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own tracks and share them with others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"410\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.poster.avif?t=1787349845\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.webm?t=1787349845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.mp4?t=1787349845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The developer posts regular updates on <strong>Discord</strong>\u00a0- feel free to join and chat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/c60746c047dc8178ffc2d9ab2722cd50.poster.avif?t=1787349845\" width=\"1024\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/c60746c047dc8178ffc2d9ab2722cd50.webm?t=1787349845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/c60746c047dc8178ffc2d9ab2722cd50.mp4?t=1787349845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Tap to the beat to build speed! Pulse Drive is an arcade racer with a rhythm element. Casually enjoy a ride through original dreamlike environments, challenge yourself to complete all the tracks, or challenge your friends on the leaderboards!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/695126dab6508f3382a48fb1791fc12da2561743/header.jpg?t=1787349845", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Racing", "Rhythm", "Driving", "Parkour", "Relaxing", "Exploration"], "developers": "Nemi", "publishers": "Nemi", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3793800", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 April 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.b